      *===============================================================*
      *                                                               *
      *  Additional information about BSPF0100:                       *
      *  Based-on physical file                                       *
      *                                                               *
      *===============================================================*
      *
      *  list API format BSPF0100
      *  (data structure can be used within the calling program
      *  to splitt XData into its units.)
     D BSPF0100        DS           256
     D  BFFILE                 1     10A
     D  BFLIB                 11     20A
     D  BFRCDFMT              21     30A
      *
